cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Universal Law Workspace"
message: >-
  This repository pins the public default tips of the Universal Law research
  program's repositories as git submodules. It holds no proofs of its own.
  Status labels live in the program's registers; a pin here is a pointer to a
  commit, not a verdict on its contents, and no original prize problem is
  solved.
type: software
authors:
